{"content":[{"c":["GOLDSMITH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Artisan who specialized in fine gold work. They fashioned costly and elegant idols for pagan worship (",{"href":"?bref=Isa.40.19","r":"Isa.40.19","rawR":"Isa.40.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.40.19","value":"Isa.40.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 40:19"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Isa.41.7","r":"Isa.41.7","rawR":"Isa.41.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.41.7","value":"Isa.41.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"41:7"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Isa.46.6","r":"Isa.46.6","rawR":"Isa.46.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.46.6","value":"Isa.46.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"46:6"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Jer.10.9,14","r":"Jer.10.9,14","rawR":"Jer.10.9,14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.10.9,14","value":"Jer.10.9,14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 10:9, 14"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Jer.51.17","r":"Jer.51.17","rawR":"Jer.51.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.51.17","value":"Jer.51.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"51:17"},") and prepared items and gold plating for the tabernacle (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.31.4","r":"Exod.31.4","rawR":"Exod.31.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.31.4","value":"Exod.31.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 31:4"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Exod.35.32","r":"Exod.35.32","rawR":"Exod.35.32","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.35.32","value":"Exod.35.32"}],"t":"ref","v":"35:32"},") and Solomon’s temple (",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.6.20-35","r":"1Kgs.6.20-35","rawR":"1Kgs.6.20-35","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.6.20-35","value":"1Kgs.6.20-35"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Kgs 6:20-35"},"). They formed a guild in postexilic times and assisted in the restoration and repair of the temple (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.3.8,31-32","r":"Neh.3.8,31-32","rawR":"Neh.3.8,31-32","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.3.8,31-32","value":"Neh.3.8,31-32"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 3:8, 31-32"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=MineralsandMetals_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"MineralsandMetals_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"MineralsandMetals_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"lin